{
  "id": "temporal-forces-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Temporal Forces Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Temporal Forces prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 9–10 and 16–17 March 2024, and sold by shops in the Prerelease Program. Each box held four Temporal Forces booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Temporal Forces logo. The decks also held non-holo copies of Feraligatr, Iron Thorns, Flutter Mane, Relicanth, Koraidon and Miraidon, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
